  "confirmed": {
    "italy": [
      "The official client constructs /evento/{numeric_id} detail URLs from data-id_evento.",
      "The independently read event 32692 detail says 27 October 2026 11:00; Rome normalization is 10:00 UTC.",
      "Only future featured cards are retained; VOD/live cards and starts outside the current 30-day window are omitted. This is not an exhaustive calendar.",
      "Room/category labels and stable official IDs are preserved. Unknown future ends are not taken from archive fields or next starts."
    ],
    "taiwan": [
      "The modern-TLS official portal explicitly identifies ly1 and ly2 as its two channels. Its own client requests api/get_program.php with ch and a YYYY/MM/DD date from the date picker.",
      "Bounded requests for both feeds on two dates return different dated programme arrays. The collector requests both feeds over three source-local dates.",
